Package: hd-screensaver
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: hyprland, kitty, python3-terminaltexteffects, jq, procps
Enhances: hd-desktop
Replaces: hd-desktop (<< 0.2)
Breaks: hd-desktop (<< 0.2)
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: HyprDebian screensaver
 The screensaver of the HyprDebian desktop: a full screen kitty window on
 every monitor that shows a text with random effects of terminal text
 effects, and stops on a key press or when it loses the focus. hypridle of
 hd-desktop starts it after 2 minutes and stops it when the screen locks.
 .
 The text is ~/.config/hyprdebian/screensaver.txt of the user, or
 /usr/share/hd-screensaver/screensaver.txt when the user has none.
